  "body": "## What changed\n\nAdd three lines to the Live GUI session entry in `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`.\n\n- Document `camcraft-cli --ui call <tool> <json>` and the shared History and live gate.\n- Document exit 3 with no running window and no headless fallback.\n- Document exit 2 when multiple windows need a selection. Nothing runs.\n- Show explicit selection with `--window <pid|project>`.\n\nThe text does not promise selection of the first running window. The current implementation refuses that ambiguous case.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `git diff --check` and `git diff origin/main..HEAD --check`: passed.\n- Current help source: `crates/app/src/cli_ui.rs:16-42`.\n- Parser source: `crates/app/src/cli_ui.rs:58-87`.\n- Exit mappings and ambiguous selection: `crates/app/src/mcp/link_client.rs:62-84,209-231`.\n- Shared History and live gate: `crates/ui/src/mcp_host.rs:11-30,43-66`.\n- Independent read-only verification found no defect.\n- Reused `target/debug/xtask` with `CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR=\"$PWD/xtask\" timeout 30 ./target/debug/xtask gate quick --base origin/main --dry-run`. The plan selected zero steps: `nothing in crates/ changed: no tests to run`. This is a selection result, not a test pass.\n- The final path audit shows only the skill file, with three added lines.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNo new build, Rust test, catalog suite, integration suite, light or heavy lane, GUI test, or runtime CLI check ran. This change is documentation only. The command and exit codes were checked against source, including the help string. No CLI executable was available in the checked existing build paths. `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` is unchanged; the merging session owns the bump.\n\nProcess change: yes\nChangelog: none\nEffort: low\n\nCloses #3864\nFixes #3864\n",
